<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82441" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιφαίνομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be visible all
				round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεος . . ἕκαθεν περιφαινομένοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.179
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν σκοπιῇ, περιφαινομένῳ ἐνὶ χώρῳ,
					βωμὸν ποιήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ven.</u>
					100
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν περιφαινομένῳ</span>
			(without Subst.) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.476
			</span></i> : generally, <i>to be visible</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσση π. ὀκλάξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					517
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shine around</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.932b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later, in 
				Act.
			, <i>display all round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
				17.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
